msgid "Replaces all of the occurrences of the substring in the given string. *New in V9.*"
msgstr "指定した文字列のサブストリングのすべての発生を置換します。*V9 の新しい。*"

#: ../../03_ride-language/13_function-reference/v9.md:6
msgid "`replaceFirst(str: String, target: String, replacement: String): String`"
msgstr "`replaceFirst(str: String, target: String, replacement: String): String`"

