msgstr "P-256 の署名を指定します。*V9 の新しい。*"

#: ../../03_ride-language/13_function-reference/v9.md:6
msgid "`validateCertificateChain(certificateChain: List[ByteVector], crls: List[ByteVector], timestamp: Int): ByteVector`"
msgstr "`validateCertificateChain(certificateChain: List[ByteVector], crls: List[ByteVector], timestamp: Int): ByteVector`"

#: ../../03_ride-language/13_function-reference/v9.md:6
